# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Forge Capmoor — environment
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Copy to `.env` (or set in your host's dashboard) before deploying.

# Endpoint that receives account-creation form submissions.
#
# The form POSTs a JSON body of { firstName, lastName, email, phone, source }
# and expects a 2xx response. Anything that accepts a JSON POST works — a
# Formspree/Basin URL, a serverless function, your own API.
#
# `source` is always "forge-capmoor.net", so submissions from a staging or
# preview deployment are distinguishable from production ones.
#
# If this is left empty the form still renders, validates and reports errors,
# but on submit it tells the visitor plainly that nothing was sent rather than
# pretending it succeeded — and it does not redirect to /thank-you. Only a real
# 2xx response navigates there.
VITE_CONTACT_ENDPOINT=
